<title>PHILIPPINES: Cosmos says Paribas to get one board seat.</title>
<headline>Cosmos says Paribas to get one board seat.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cosmos Bottling Corp said on Monday Paribas Principal Investment, a leading European financial institution, has recently acquired a substantial stake in the company and will therefore be invited to join the seven-man Cosmos board.</p>
<p>Cosmos is the beverage unit of diversified food concern RFM Corp.</p>
</text>
